# Website deploy (rechnerlotsen.com)

Repo: `C:\allmystuff\Rechnerlotsen\rechnerlotsen.com`. Use skill `deploy-website` when asked.

## Flow

1. Commit and push to `main` on the website repo
2. `./scripts/trigger-preview-deploy.sh main` (needs `DEPLOY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`)
3. Wait for preview to finish (watch deploy commit / health on rl-intern)
4. `./scripts/trigger-production-deploy.sh` (needs webhook + `DEPLOY_TRIGGER_SECRET`)
5. **Confirm PIN popup** on rl-intern preview site
6. Wait for production deploy commit / verify live site

## Notes

- Preview can auto-shut down after ~1h → **502** until redeployed
- Affiliate ID / support / tagging changes land via this website deploy, not the extension
- Do not invent alternate deploy paths; use the trigger scripts
